    <bpmn:process id="W_W522" name="W522. POS Daily Transaction Review &amp; Cashier Performance Audit" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily — Store Manager morning routine (before store opening or within first hour)
Frequency: Daily per store
Volume: 200 stores × 365 days = 73,000 reviews/year
Owner: Store Manager
Participants: Store Manager, Lead Cashier (follow-up), Regional Manager (weekly summary)
Source: workflow W522 — POS Daily Transaction Review &amp; Cashier Performance Audit</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W522_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W522_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W522_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W522_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W522_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W522_Lane2" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W522_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W522_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W522_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W522_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W522_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W522_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W522_Lane3" name="Regional Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W522_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W522_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W522_Start5" name="Daily — Store Manager morning routine (before store opening or within first hour)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W522_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W522_Task6" name="Cashier Performance Dashboard">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System automatically generates Cashier Performance Dashboard overnight from prior day&#x27;s transaction data: per-cashier metrics — transaction count, average transaction value, average transaction time (scan-to-receipt), items per transaction, void count and void value, refund count and refund value, price override count and override value, discount count and discount value, loyalty scan rate (% of transactions with loyalty card), tender type distribution, cash variance (from W5F/W517 handover)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W522_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W522_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W522_Task7" name="Store Manager opens Cashier Performance Dashboard on terminal or tablet during…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Store Manager opens Cashier Performance Dashboard on terminal or tablet during morning routine; reviews each cashier&#x27;s metrics against store average and chain benchmark (provided by Finance/Operations team)
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W522_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W522_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W522_Task8" name="exception alerts">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System highlights exception alerts for cashiers with metrics outside normal bands: void rate &gt; 2× store average, average transaction value deviation &gt; ±30% from store average, cash variance &gt; PHP 200, price override rate &gt; 2× store average, refund rate &gt; 2× store average, loyalty scan rate &lt; 50% (potential missed enrollment opportunity), transaction speed &lt; 50th percentile (slow cashier — training candidate)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W522_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W522_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W522_Task9" name="high-value transactions">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Store Manager reviews high-value transactions from prior day (transactions &gt; PHP 50,000): spot-checks tender type, customer identification (if per W530), price overrides, and item composition for reasonableness
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W522_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W522_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W522_Task10" name="void and refund detail">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Store Manager reviews void and refund detail: for each void/refund, system displays original transaction details, void/refund reason code, authorizing manager ID, and item list; Store Manager verifies authorization was appropriate
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W522_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W522_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W522_Task11" name="discount and promotional application">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Store Manager reviews discount and promotional application: system shows discount distribution by type (employee, senior citizen, PWD, price override, promotional, competitor match); flags unusual patterns (e.g., same customer receiving multiple discounts in one day, employee discount applied to non-employee)
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W522_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W522_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W522_Task12" name="If any exception alerts or anomalies are identified: Store Manager documents…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: If any exception alerts or anomalies are identified: Store Manager documents findings and assigns follow-up actions — retraining for cashier (W518), LP investigation for suspected fraud (W37/W466), cashier performance discussion (W72)
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min if any</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W522_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W522_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W522_Task13" name="Weekly: Store Manager compiles cashier performance ranking for weekly team…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Weekly: Store Manager compiles cashier performance ranking for weekly team meeting; recognizes top-performing cashiers; identifies bottom performers for targeted coaching; submits weekly cashier summary to Regional Manager
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): Regional Manager
Duration: 30 min/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W522_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W522_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W522_Task14" name="Monthly: Regional Manager reviews cashier performance data across all stores in…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Monthly: Regional Manager reviews cashier performance data across all stores in region; identifies stores with consistently high void rates, low loyalty scan rates, or high cash variances for Store Manager coaching and process improvement
Responsible (R): Regional Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W522_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W522_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W522_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W522_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W522_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-263 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Processing (PA-08.1).) | - operational: Store Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Store Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W522_Assoc17" sourceRef="W522_Annotation16" targetRef="W522_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W522_Flow18" sourceRef="W522_Start5" targetRef="W522_Task6" />
