    <bpmn:process id="W_W525" name="W525. POS Continuous Near-Real-Time Sync &amp; Nightly Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous: POS transactions stream to ERP in near-real-time (&lt; 30 sec per event via W533 event bus). Nightly: scheduled reconciliation batch (typically 1:00–4:00 AM, after all stores closed per NFR-015)
Frequency: Continuous (every transaction) + nightly reconciliation batch (daily)
Volume: ~93,333 POS transactions/day streamed continuously + 600 terminals × nightly reconciliation cycle
Owner: IT Operations (reconciliation monitoring); System (automated execution)
Participants: IT Operations, System, Store Manager (alert recipient if reconciliation failure)
Source: workflow W525 — POS Continuous Near-Real-Time Sync &amp; Nightly Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
