    <bpmn:process id="W_W528" name="W528. POS Digital Receipt / E-Receipt Delivery" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer opts for e-receipt at point of sale (instead of or in addition to paper receipt)
Frequency: Per transaction — increasing adoption as e-receipt awareness grows; estimated 20–30% of transactions opt for e-receipt
Volume: ~560,000–840,000 e-receipts/month chain-wide (20–30% of 2.8M monthly transactions)
Owner: Cashier (offer); System (delivery)
Participants: Cashier, Customer, System, Marketing Team (analytics)
Source: workflow W528 — POS Digital Receipt / E-Receipt Delivery</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W528_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W528_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W528_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W528_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W528_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W528_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W528_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W528_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W528_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W528_Lane2" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W528_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W528_Lane3" name="Marketing Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W528_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W528_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W528_Start5" name="Customer opts for e-receipt at point of sale (instead of or in addition to paper receipt)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W528_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W528_Task6" name="After tender completion (W5B.8), system prompts Cashier: &quot;Would customer like a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: After tender completion (W5B.8), system prompts Cashier: &quot;Would customer like a digital receipt?&quot; with options: Paper Only / Email / SMS / Both (Paper + Digital)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated prompt</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W528_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W528_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W528_Task7" name="Cashier asks customer preference; if customer selects Email or SMS: Cashier…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Cashier asks customer preference; if customer selects Email or SMS: Cashier selects delivery method on POS terminal; if customer is loyalty member and email/mobile is on file: system auto-populates from customer record; if not loyalty member: Cashier enters customer email address or mobile number on POS screen
Responsible (R): Cashier / Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W528_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W528_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W528_Task8" name="System generates BIR-compliant e-receipt with all required elements: TIN…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System generates BIR-compliant e-receipt with all required elements: TIN, registered invoice/official receipt number (from CAS permit per W54A), CAS permit number, business name and address, transaction date/time, itemized line items with VAT, VAT amount, total, tender type, cashier ID; e-receipt includes &quot;E-RECEIPT&quot; watermark and digital delivery confirmation reference
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W528_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W528_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W528_Task9" name="System transmits e-receipt: Email — sent via transactional email service with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: System transmits e-receipt: Email — sent via transactional email service with receipt as HTML body and PDF attachment; SMS — sent as SMS with link to web-hosted receipt (receipt too long for SMS body); system logs delivery attempt with timestamp
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W528_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W528_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W528_Task10" name="System tracks delivery status: Sent → Delivered (email open / SMS link clicked)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: System tracks delivery status: Sent → Delivered (email open / SMS link clicked) → Failed (bounce, invalid number, timeout); if delivery fails within 5 minutes: system falls back to printing paper receipt; Cashier hands paper receipt to customer with &quot;Digital receipt delivery failed — here is your printed receipt&quot;
Responsible (R): System / Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated + 15 sec if fallback</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W528_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W528_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W528_Task11" name="BIR compliance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: BIR compliance: e-receipt is in addition to (not replacement for) the POS terminal&#x27;s internal transaction record; the CAS-registered transaction record stored on the POS terminal (and uploaded via W525 nightly batch) serves as the BIR-registered original; e-receipt is a copy delivery mechanism; BIR requires that the POS terminal retains the registered transaction regardless of receipt format
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W528_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W528_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W528_Task12" name="Customer receives e-receipt; e-receipt includes link to rate shopping…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Customer receives e-receipt; e-receipt includes link to rate shopping experience (W65 CSAT/NPS survey QR code) and link to loyalty program enrollment (W263) if not already a member
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W528_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W528_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W528_Task13" name="Monthly: Marketing Team reviews e-receipt adoption analytics — adoption rate by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Monthly: Marketing Team reviews e-receipt adoption analytics — adoption rate by store, delivery method preference (email vs. SMS), delivery success rate, survey click-through rate from e-receipt, enrollment conversion rate from e-receipt link; identifies stores with low adoption for POS signage promoting e-receipt option
Responsible (R): Marketing Team
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 1 hour/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W528_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W528_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W528_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W528_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W528_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-263 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Processing (PA-08.1).) | - operational: must include consent capture (opt-in checkbox on POS screen)
Owner: Cashier (offer); System (delivery)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W528_Assoc16" sourceRef="W528_Annotation15" targetRef="W528_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
