    <bpmn:process id="W_W532" name="W532. POS Clearance &amp; &quot;Final Sale&quot; Item Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Cashier scans an item flagged as &quot;Clearance / Final Sale&quot; in the product master
Frequency: Variable — higher during seasonal transitions (January post-Christmas, June back-to-school, October pre-holiday clearance) and markdown events (W93)
Volume: Estimated 5–15% of transactions during active clearance periods; ~2–5% during normal periods
Owner: Cashier (processing); Store Manager (clearance authorization)
Participants: Cashier, Customer, Store Manager, Merchandising Team (clearance pricing per W93)
Source: workflow W532 — POS Clearance &amp; &quot;Final Sale&quot; Item Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W532_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W532_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W532_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W532_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W532_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W532_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W532_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W532_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W532_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W532_Lane2" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W532_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W532_Lane3" name="Merchandising Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W532_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W532_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W532_Start5" name="Cashier scans an item flagged as &quot;Clearance / Final Sale&quot; in the product master">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W532_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W532_Task6" name="Cashier scans item barcode; system identifies item as &quot;Clearance&quot; status from…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Cashier scans item barcode; system identifies item as &quot;Clearance&quot; status from item master lifecycle status (W315 — product lifecycle status) and &quot;Final Sale&quot; flag from markdown configuration (W93)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W532_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W532_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W532_Task7" name="System applies clearance price (already configured per W93 markdown process)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System applies clearance price (already configured per W93 markdown process); customer display shows item name, original price (strikethrough), clearance price, and &quot;CLEARANCE — FINAL SALE&quot; label
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W532_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W532_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W532_Task8" name="POS terminal displays prominent notification to Cashier: &quot;CLEARANCE ITEM — No…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: POS terminal displays prominent notification to Cashier: &quot;CLEARANCE ITEM — No Returns. Verbal confirmation required.&quot;; Cashier verbally informs customer: &quot;This item is on clearance — it&#x27;s a final sale with no returns or exchanges&quot;
Responsible (R): System / Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W532_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W532_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W532_Task9" name="Cashier confirms verbal disclosure by pressing &quot;Acknowledge&quot; on POS terminal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Cashier confirms verbal disclosure by pressing &quot;Acknowledge&quot; on POS terminal; if Cashier does not acknowledge within 10 seconds: system re-prompts; acknowledgment is required before transaction can proceed past this scan
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W532_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W532_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W532_Task10" name="Customer-facing display shows clearance item details with &quot;FINAL SALE — No…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Customer-facing display shows clearance item details with &quot;FINAL SALE — No Returns or Exchanges&quot; notice in prominent text; customer can see this before completing purchase
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W532_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W532_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W532_Task11" name="Transaction proceeds per standard W5B; receipt prints &quot;FINAL SALE&quot; notation on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Transaction proceeds per standard W5B; receipt prints &quot;FINAL SALE&quot; notation on each clearance line item with &quot;No returns or exchanges&quot; statement at receipt bottom (if any clearance items in transaction)
Responsible (R): System / Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Per W5B</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W532_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W532_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W532_Task12" name="Return attempt block">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Return attempt block: if customer later attempts to return a final-sale item (W12): system displays &quot;This item was sold as FINAL SALE — returns and exchanges are not accepted&quot;; Cashier cannot process return for final-sale items; Store Manager override required for any exception (Store Manager documents exception reason per W5B.4a)
Responsible (R): System / Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 2 min if return attempted</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W532_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W532_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W532_Task13" name="Weekly: Merchandising Team reviews clearance sell-through report — clearance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Weekly: Merchandising Team reviews clearance sell-through report — clearance items sold, remaining clearance inventory, sell-through rate by category, days since markdown; identifies clearance items with low sell-through for further markdown (W93) or write-off (W220)
Responsible (R): Merchandising Team
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1 hour/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W532_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W532_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W532_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W532_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W532_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-263 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Processing (PA-08.1).) | - operational: block at return (W12) prevents override except by Store Manager
Owner: Cashier (processing); Store Manager (clearance authorization)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
