    <bpmn:process id="W_W533" name="W533. POS Real-Time Event Streaming &amp; Continuous Sync" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Every completed POS transaction (sale, void, return, refund, layaway payment, gift card issuance/redemption)
Frequency: Continuous — every transaction generates an event; ~93,333 events/day across 600 terminals
Volume: Peak: ~2,000 events/minute during weekend sale events; average: ~65 events/minute
Owner: IT Operations (event bus infrastructure); System (automated processing)
Participants: POS Terminal, ERP Message Bus, ERP Modules (Inventory, GL, Loyalty, BI), IT Operations
Source: workflow W533 — POS Real-Time Event Streaming &amp; Continuous Sync</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W533_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W533_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W533_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W533_Start3" name="Every completed POS transaction (sale, void, return, refund, layaway payment, gift card…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W533_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W533_Task4" name="Cashier completes transaction at POS terminal (sale, void, return, refund per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Cashier completes transaction at POS terminal (sale, void, return, refund per W5B); terminal generates complete event payload: transaction ID, timestamp, terminal ID, store ID, cashier ID, line items (SKU, quantity, price, discounts, catch-weight details), tender breakdown, customer ID (if loyalty/trade), authorization details (if void/override), event sequence number
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 1 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W533_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W533_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W533_Task5" name="Terminal publishes event to ERP message bus via HTTPS/REST; event is encrypted…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Terminal publishes event to ERP message bus via HTTPS/REST; event is encrypted in transit; message bus acknowledges receipt with sequence-confirmed response; if acknowledgment not received within 30 seconds: event queued locally for retry (offline mode per W535)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W533_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W533_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W533_Task6" name="Message bus persists event to durable storage; assigns internal event ID; event…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Message bus persists event to durable storage; assigns internal event ID; event is now immutable and tamper-evident (hash chain)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 1 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W533_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W533_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W533_Task7" name="Inventory consumer">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Inventory consumer: ERP inventory module consumes event; deducts quantities from store location on-hand; updates available-to-promise (ATP) for all channels (ecommerce, BOPIS, marketplace); publishes inventory update event for downstream consumers
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 60 sec from sale</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W533_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W533_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W533_Task8" name="GL consumer">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: GL consumer: ERP financial module consumes event; posts journal entries (Dr. Cash/AR / Cr. Revenue, Dr. COGS / Cr. Inventory, VAT entries); entries posted per transaction (not batched)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 60 sec from sale</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W533_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W533_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W533_Task9" name="Loyalty consumer">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Loyalty consumer: Loyalty engine (in-house stack — fit-gap D9) consumes event; posts points earned to customer account; processes points redeemed (if applicable); updates customer tier progress
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 60 sec from sale</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W533_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W533_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W533_Task10" name="Ecommerce ATP consumer">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Ecommerce ATP consumer: ecommerce module consumes inventory update event; updates per-store and per-DC availability on website/app within 5 minutes; prevents overselling
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 5 min from sale</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W533_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W533_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W533_Task11" name="BI consumer">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: BI consumer: analytics module consumes event; updates real-time sales dashboards, store performance, category sales velocity
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 5 min from sale</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W533_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W533_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W533_Task12" name="Continuous price push (inbound)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Continuous price push (inbound): throughout the day, ERP publishes price change events, new item events, discontinued item events, and promotional rule events to the message bus; POS terminals subscribe and apply updates to local data store within 60 seconds of publication (per POS-047); enables same-day promo launches and emergency price freezes (POS-024) without waiting for nightly batch
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 60 sec per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W533_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W533_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W533_Task13" name="Offline event replay">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: Offline event replay: when POS terminal reconnects after offline period (per W5G), terminal replays all queued offline events from last-acknowledged sequence number; ERP deduplicates and processes in original sequence order; zero data loss guaranteed
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2–5 min per offline shift</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W533_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W533_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W533_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W533_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W533_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-263 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Processing (PA-08.1).) | - operational: failover
Owner: IT Operations (event bus infrastructure); System (automated processing)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W533_Assoc16" sourceRef="W533_Annotation15" targetRef="W533_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W533_Flow17" sourceRef="W533_Start3" targetRef="W533_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W533_Flow18" sourceRef="W533_Task4" targetRef="W533_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W533_Flow19" sourceRef="W533_Task5" targetRef="W533_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W533_Flow20" sourceRef="W533_Task6" targetRef="W533_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W533_Flow21" sourceRef="W533_Task7" targetRef="W533_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W533_Flow22" sourceRef="W533_Task8" targetRef="W533_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W533_Flow23" sourceRef="W533_Task9" targetRef="W533_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W533_Flow24" sourceRef="W533_Task10" targetRef="W533_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W533_Flow25" sourceRef="W533_Task11" targetRef="W533_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W533_Flow26" sourceRef="W533_Task12" targetRef="W533_Task13" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W533_Flow27" sourceRef="W533_Task13" targetRef="W533_End14" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W533_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W533_plane" bpmnElement="W_W533">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W533_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W533_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="2420" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
