    <bpmn:process id="W_W536" name="W536. Unified Order Management &amp; Cross-Channel Fulfillment Routing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Order placed from any channel (POS, ecommerce, marketplace, mobile app, trade counter/pro desk)
Frequency: Continuous — ~95,000 orders/day across all channels (93,333 POS + ~1,430 ecommerce + marketplace)
Volume: Peak: 3× normal during sale events (~285,000 orders/day)
Owner: Unified Order Management engine (system); Ecommerce Operations Manager (monitoring); Store Manager (store-origin fulfillment)
Participants: Customer, System (order routing), Sales Associate (POS), Stock Associate (store pick), DC Picker (DC pick), Drop-Ship Vendor, 3PL Carrier, CSR
Source: workflow W536 — Unified Order Management &amp; Cross-Channel Fulfillment Routing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W536_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W536_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W536_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W536_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W536_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W536_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W536_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W536_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W536_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W536_Lane2" name="Stock Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W536_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W536_Lane3" name="CSR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W536_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W536_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W536_Start5" name="Order placed from any channel (POS, ecommerce, marketplace, mobile app, trade counter/pro…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W536_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W536_Task6" name="Order intake">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Order intake: order received from any channel: (a) in-store POS (W5B, W534 mixed basket), (b) ecommerce website/app (W11, W19), (c) marketplace Lazada/Shopee (W180), (d) trade counter/pro desk (W112), (e) mobile app; system normalizes order to unified format regardless of channel
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 5 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W536_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W536_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W536_Task7" name="ATP evaluation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: ATP evaluation: system checks available-to-promise inventory across all fulfillment origins for each line item: (a) store-level ATP (on-hand − allocated − safety stock) for 200 stores, (b) DC-level ATP for 4 DCs, (c) vendor ATP (if available via vendor portal) for drop-ship items, (d) dark store ATP for fulfillment hubs (W210); evaluates inventory allocation per channel rules (INV-019 multi-channel allocation governance)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 10 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W536_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W536_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W536_Task8" name="Fulfillment routing decision">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Fulfillment routing decision: system determines optimal fulfillment origin(s) per line item based on configurable routing rules: (a) single-origin preferred (lowest cost, fastest delivery), (b) proximity to customer address (for delivery orders), (c) store with highest ATP for BOPIS, (d) DC with best carrier coverage for home delivery, (e) vendor direct for drop-ship-only items, (f) cost optimization (compare store pick labor vs. DC pick + shipping vs. drop-ship margin), (g) split fulfillment when no single origin has ATP for all items
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: &lt; 10 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W536_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W536_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W536_Task9" name="Fulfillment order creation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Fulfillment order creation: system creates fulfillment order(s) per routing decision: (a) one fulfillment order per origin (store pick, DC pick, vendor ship), (b) all fulfillment orders linked to parent sales order, (c) each fulfillment order gets its own tracking number, carrier assignment, and SLA, (d) customer receives unified order confirmation with per-origin delivery estimates
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W536_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W536_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W536_Task10" name="Fulfillment execution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Fulfillment execution: each fulfillment origin executes per its standard workflow: (a) store pick (W11, W19B), (b) DC pick/pack/ship (W4, W19), (c) vendor direct ship (W246), (d) dark store fulfillment (W210); fulfillment status updates published to UOM engine in real-time
Responsible (R): Stock Associate / DC Picker / Vendor
Accountable (A): Store Manager / DC Supervisor
Duration: Per origin workflow SLA</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W536_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W536_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W536_Task11" name="Order status aggregation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Order status aggregation: UOM engine aggregates fulfillment status from all origins into unified order status: (a) all items pending → &quot;Processing&quot;, (b) some items shipped → &quot;Partially Shipped&quot;, (c) all items shipped/delivered → &quot;Completed&quot;, (d) any item failed → &quot;Partial Exception&quot; with per-item detail; customer sees unified status via channel of origin (POS receipt tracking link, website order page, marketplace)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W536_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W536_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W536_Task12" name="Exception handling">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Exception handling: if any fulfillment origin fails (item not found at pick, carrier failure, vendor delay): UOM engine initiates exception workflow per W98; evaluates re-routing options (alternative origin, substitution, backorder, cancellation); customer notified with options
Responsible (R): System / CSR
Accountable (A): Store Manager / DC Supervisor
Duration: Per W98</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W536_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W536_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W536_Task13" name="Cross-channel returns">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Cross-channel returns: customer initiates return via any channel (in-store W12, online W12B, marketplace W180); UOM engine identifies original sales order and fulfillment origin; return processed at receiving location (any store or DC); inventory returned to receiving location; refund processed from original sales order (same payment method, same GL posting reversal); cross-location inventory adjustment if return location ≠ original fulfillment location
Responsible (R): CSR / System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per W12</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W536_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W536_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W536_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W536_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W536_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-263 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Processing (PA-08.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Unified Order Management engine (system); Ecommerce Operations Manager (monitoring); Store Manager (store-origin fulfillment)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W536_Assoc16" sourceRef="W536_Annotation15" targetRef="W536_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W536_Flow17" sourceRef="W536_Start5" targetRef="W536_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W536_Flow18" sourceRef="W536_Task6" targetRef="W536_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W536_Flow19" sourceRef="W536_Task7" targetRef="W536_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W536_Flow20" sourceRef="W536_Task8" targetRef="W536_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W536_Flow21" sourceRef="W536_Task9" targetRef="W536_Task10" />
