    <bpmn:process id="W_W546" name="W546. POS Deposit &amp; Progress Payment Collection for Project Orders" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: B2B/project customer places a large order at POS or trade counter with payment in installments tied to delivery milestones
Frequency: ~2,000 project orders/month requiring progress payments (~0.07% of POS transactions)
Volume: Average project order value: ~PHP 150,000; total ~PHP 300M/month in project order revenue
Owner: Trade Account Manager (project setup); Store Manager (POS deposit collection)
Participants: Trade Account Manager, Customer (contractor/builder), Cashier (deposit processing), Finance (payment tracking)
Source: workflow W546 — POS Deposit &amp; Progress Payment Collection for Project Orders</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W546_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W546_Lane1" name="Trade Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W546_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W546_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W546_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W546_Lane2" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W546_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W546_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W546_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W546_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W546_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W546_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W546_Start5" name="B2B/project customer places a large order at POS or trade counter with payment in…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W546_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W546_Task6" name="Project order setup">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Project order setup: Trade Account Manager creates project order in ERP (or at trade counter POS) with: (a) project name and reference, (b) customer trade account, (c) total order value, (d) delivery phases with item lists and quantities per phase, (e) payment milestones (deposit %, interim payment %, final payment %), (f) delivery addresses and dates per phase; system generates project order number
Responsible (R): Trade Account Manager
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 15–30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W546_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W546_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W546_Task7" name="Deposit collection at POS">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Deposit collection at POS: customer pays initial deposit at POS or trade counter; cashier recalls project order by project order number; system displays deposit amount due; cashier processes deposit via standard POS tender (W5B.7); receipt prints &quot;PROJECT ORDER — DEPOSIT&quot; with project order number, deposit amount, total order value, and remaining balance; deposit posted to customer deposit liability GL
Responsible (R): Cashier / System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 5–10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W546_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W546_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W546_Task8" name="Phase delivery and interim payment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Phase delivery and interim payment: as each delivery phase is executed (W19 home delivery or W109 store pickup), system generates interim payment due notification; customer pays interim amount at POS (or via bank transfer for trade accounts); system links payment to project order and specific delivery phase; inventory released per delivery phase; system updates project order balance
Responsible (R): Cashier / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5–10 min per payment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W546_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W546_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W546_Task9" name="Final payment and project close">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Final payment and project close: upon final delivery phase completion, system generates final payment due notification; customer pays remaining balance; system completes project order: (a) full revenue recognized, (b) all inventory fully transferred, (c) project order status set to &quot;Completed&quot;, (d) final invoice generated per BIR requirements, (e) project order archived for warranty reference (W33)
Responsible (R): Cashier / System
Accountable (A): Store Manager / Finance
Duration: 5–10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W546_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W546_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W546_Task10" name="Balance monitoring and aging">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Balance monitoring and aging: Finance monitors project order balances: (a) overdue progress payments flagged, (b) payment aging report per project order, (c) collection escalation per FIN-028 for overdue payments, (d) project order holds on future deliveries if payment overdue &gt; 30 days
Responsible (R): Finance / System
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: Weekly review ~2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W546_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W546_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W546_Task11" name="Project order modification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Project order modification: if project scope changes (additional items, quantity changes, delivery date changes): Trade Account Manager modifies project order; system recalculates payment milestones; additional deposit collected if order value increases; Store Manager approval required for modifications &gt; 20% of original order value
Responsible (R): Trade Account Manager / Store Manager
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 10–20 min per modification</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W546_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W546_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W546_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W546_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W546_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-263 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Processing (PA-08.1).) | - operational: deposit requirements, delivery holds for overdue payments, and trade credit insurance; operational: documented change orders with customer sign-off; operational: automated recognition tied to delivery completion
Owner: Trade Account Manager (project setup); Store Manager (POS deposit collection)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W546_Assoc14" sourceRef="W546_Annotation13" targetRef="W546_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W546_Flow15" sourceRef="W546_Start5" targetRef="W546_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W546_Flow16" sourceRef="W546_Task6" targetRef="W546_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W546_Flow17" sourceRef="W546_Task7" targetRef="W546_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W546_Flow18" sourceRef="W546_Task8" targetRef="W546_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W546_Flow19" sourceRef="W546_Task9" targetRef="W546_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W546_Flow20" sourceRef="W546_Task10" targetRef="W546_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W546_Flow21" sourceRef="W546_Task11" targetRef="W546_End12" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W546_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W546_plane" bpmnElement="W_W546">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W546_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W546_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1580" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
