    <bpmn:process id="W_W550" name="W550. POS Loyalty Points as Payment Tender" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer at POS chooses to redeem loyalty points as partial or full payment
Frequency: ~28,000 points-as-tender transactions/month (~1% of POS transactions)
Volume: Average points redemption: ~PHP 450 per transaction; total ~PHP 12.6M/month in points tender
Owner: CRM/Loyalty Manager (program rules); Store Manager (POS compliance)
Participants: Cashier (processing), Customer, System (validation and redemption)
Source: workflow W550 — POS Loyalty Points as Payment Tender</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W550_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W550_Lane1" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W550_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W550_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W550_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W550_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W550_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W550_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W550_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W550_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W550_Lane3" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W550_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W550_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W550_Start5" name="Customer at POS chooses to redeem loyalty points as partial or full payment">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W550_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W550_Task6" name="Customer identifies loyalty membership">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer identifies loyalty membership: customer presents loyalty card, mobile app QR, or provides registered phone number; cashier scans or enters identifier; system retrieves loyalty account: points balance, tier status, eligible points for redemption (minimum threshold, e.g., 100 points = PHP 100 per the 1-point-per-PHP-1 rule)
Responsible (R): Cashier / Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15–30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W550_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W550_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W550_Task7" name="Points-to-currency conversion display">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Points-to-currency conversion display: system displays available points balance and equivalent currency value on cashier and customer-facing screens; conversion rate per program rules (configurable, default: 1 point = PHP 1 per profile §9.2); system shows maximum amount payable with points
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W550_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W550_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W550_Task8" name="Customer selects points redemption amount">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Customer selects points redemption amount: customer chooses to redeem: (a) full balance (up to transaction total), (b) specific amount, or (c) specific points quantity; system validates: (a) minimum redemption threshold met, (b) sufficient points available, (c) points not frozen (under investigation per W496 loyalty fraud), (d) within single-transaction redemption cap (configurable, default: PHP 5,000/transaction)
Responsible (R): Customer / Cashier / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W550_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W550_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W550_Task9" name="Points tender processing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Points tender processing: system applies points redemption as tender line: (a) points deducted from loyalty account balance in real-time, (b) points redemption event published via W533, (c) receipt shows points redeemed, equivalent currency value, and remaining points balance, (d) remaining transaction balance (if any) payable via other tender methods (cash, card, e-wallet — standard multi-tender per POS-004)
Responsible (R): System / Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10–15 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W550_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W550_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W550_Task10" name="Deferred revenue recognition">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Deferred revenue recognition: system posts points redemption to deferred revenue reversal: (a) loyalty points were accrued as deferred revenue liability when earned (FIN-039, PFRS 15), (b) at redemption, deferred revenue reversed and recognized as revenue reduction, (c) GL posting: DR Loyalty Deferred Revenue / CR Sales Revenue; loyalty liability reduced on balance sheet
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W550_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W550_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W550_Task11" name="Offline points redemption">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Offline points redemption: if POS is offline (W535): system allows points redemption from cached loyalty balance (per offline capability matrix — degraded mode with floor limit, default PHP 1,000); points deducted locally and queued for sync; on reconnection, points reconciliation per W5G resolves any conflicts (e.g., points spent at another store during offline period)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Per W535</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W550_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W550_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W550_Task12" name="Points redemption reversal on return">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Points redemption reversal on return: if transaction containing points redemption is returned (W12): system reverses points redemption — points restored to customer&#x27;s account; deferred revenue re-accrued; if partial return, proportional points restored
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Per W12</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W550_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W550_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W550_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W550_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W550_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-263 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Processing (PA-08.1).) | - operational: floor limit and reconciliation per W5G; operational: real-time event-driven processing; operational: clear display on customer-facing screen and receipt
Owner: CRM/Loyalty Manager (program rules); Store Manager (POS compliance)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W550_Assoc15" sourceRef="W550_Annotation14" targetRef="W550_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W550_Flow16" sourceRef="W550_Start5" targetRef="W550_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W550_Flow17" sourceRef="W550_Task6" targetRef="W550_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W550_Flow18" sourceRef="W550_Task7" targetRef="W550_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W550_Flow19" sourceRef="W550_Task8" targetRef="W550_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W550_Flow20" sourceRef="W550_Task9" targetRef="W550_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W550_Flow21" sourceRef="W550_Task10" targetRef="W550_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W550_Flow22" sourceRef="W550_Task11" targetRef="W550_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W550_Flow23" sourceRef="W550_Task12" targetRef="W550_End13" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W550_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W550_plane" bpmnElement="W_W550">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W550_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W550_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
