    <bpmn:process id="W_W551" name="W551. POS Customer On-the-Spot Loyalty Enrollment &amp; Account Lookup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Unidentified customer at POS wants to join loyalty program, check points balance, or update account details during checkout
Frequency: ~5,000–8,000 on-the-spot enrollments/month (~0.2–0.3% of POS transactions, per the enrollment canon); ~84,000 account lookups/month (~3%)
Volume: Peak: during loyalty double-points events, enrollment spikes 5×
Owner: CRM/Loyalty Manager (program enrollment); Store Manager (POS compliance)
Participants: Cashier (enrollment/lookup), Customer, System (enrollment processing)
Source: workflow W551 — POS Customer On-the-Spot Loyalty Enrollment &amp; Account Lookup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W551_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W551_Lane1" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W551_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W551_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W551_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W551_Lane2" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W551_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W551_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W551_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W551_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W551_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W551_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W551_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W551_Start5" name="Unidentified customer at POS wants to join loyalty program, check points balance, or…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W551_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W551_Task6" name="Enrollment trigger">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Enrollment trigger: during checkout, cashier asks &quot;Are you a BuildRight Rewards member?&quot;; if customer says no but wants to join, cashier taps &quot;Quick Enroll&quot; on POS; if customer is a member but forgot card, cashier taps &quot;Account Lookup&quot;
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W551_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W551_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W551_Task7" name="Quick enrollment — minimum data capture">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quick enrollment — minimum data capture: system prompts for minimum required data: (a) mobile number (primary identifier — validated via OTP sent to phone), (b) first name, (c) last name, (d) consent checkbox (RA 10173 Data Privacy Act per NFR-010); customer enters on customer-facing display (PIN pad or tablet) for privacy; no cashier data entry needed — customer self-enters
Responsible (R): Customer / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30–45 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W551_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W551_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W551_Task8" name="OTP verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OTP verification: system sends 6-digit OTP to customer&#x27;s mobile number; customer enters OTP on customer-facing display; system verifies; if OTP fails after 3 attempts, enrollment deferred to Customer Service counter (not blocking POS lane)
Responsible (R): Customer / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15–30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W551_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W551_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W551_Task9" name="Account creation and digital card issuance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Account creation and digital card issuance: system creates loyalty account: (a) generates member ID, (b) issues digital loyalty card (visible in app or SMS with barcode), (c) registers at Bronze tier (CRM-005), (d) applies welcome bonus points (if current promotion), (e) immediately applies to current transaction — points earned on this purchase; customer receives SMS confirmation with member ID and app download link
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W551_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W551_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W551_Task10" name="Account lookup (existing member)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Account lookup (existing member): if customer is existing member but forgot card/phone: cashier enters customer name or alternate identifier; system searches: (a) by registered mobile number, (b) by name + ZIP code, (c) by transaction history (if customer used same credit card previously); system displays matching accounts (masked for privacy); customer confirms identity on customer-facing display; account linked to current transaction
Responsible (R): Cashier / Customer / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30–60 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W551_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W551_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W551_Task11" name="Quick account update">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Quick account update: if customer needs to update information (new phone number, email for e-receipt): customer enters update on customer-facing display; system validates and updates with audit trail; update applied to current transaction
Responsible (R): Customer / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W551_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W551_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W551_Task12" name="Enrollment analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Enrollment analytics: daily enrollment count by store and cashier; enrollment conversion rate (enrollment offers vs. acceptances); new member first-purchase value vs. average; 30-day new member retention rate; data feeds into W263 (enrollment journey analytics)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W551_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W551_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W551_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W551_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W551_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-263 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Processing (PA-08.1).) | - operational: customer self-entry on customer-facing display and strict time cap (auto-defer to Customer Service if &gt; 90 sec); operational: dedup check (W253) at enrollment using name + phone matching; operational: 3-retry and fallback to Customer Service counter
Owner: CRM/Loyalty Manager (program enrollment); Store Manager (POS compliance)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W551_Assoc15" sourceRef="W551_Annotation14" targetRef="W551_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W551_Flow16" sourceRef="W551_Start5" targetRef="W551_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W551_Flow17" sourceRef="W551_Task6" targetRef="W551_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W551_Flow18" sourceRef="W551_Task7" targetRef="W551_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W551_Flow19" sourceRef="W551_Task8" targetRef="W551_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W551_Flow20" sourceRef="W551_Task9" targetRef="W551_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W551_Flow21" sourceRef="W551_Task10" targetRef="W551_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W551_Flow22" sourceRef="W551_Task11" targetRef="W551_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W551_Flow23" sourceRef="W551_Task12" targetRef="W551_End13" />
    </bpmn:process>
