    <bpmn:process id="W_W748" name="W748. POS Customer Loyalty On-the-Spot Upselling &amp; Cross-Selling" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer checkout in progress (W5B); system identifies upsell/cross-sell opportunity based on basket contents and loyalty profile
Frequency: Every transaction with identified loyalty member (~60% of transactions)
Volume: 200 stores × ~280 loyalty transactions/day (60% of ~467 per the Frequency) = ~56,000 upsell opportunities/day chain-wide
Owner: Cashier
Participants: Cashier, Customer
Source: workflow W748 — POS Customer Loyalty On-the-Spot Upselling &amp; Cross-Selling</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W748_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W748_Lane1" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W748_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W748_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W748_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W748_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W748_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W748_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W748_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W748_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W748_Lane3" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W748_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W748_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W748_Start5" name="Customer checkout in progress (W5B); system identifies upsell/cross-sell opportunity…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W748_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W748_Task6" name="Loyalty member identification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Loyalty member identification: Customer presents loyalty card or mobile app at checkout; system loads customer profile including tier, purchase history, and active offers
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): System
Duration: Instant</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W748_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W748_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W748_Task7" name="System upsell suggestion">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System upsell suggestion: Based on basket contents, system generates 1–3 targeted suggestions: (a) complementary item (paint → brushes, tiles → grout), (b) bundle completion (buy 2 more for bundle discount), (c) loyalty tier upgrade incentive (spend PHP 500 more to reach next tier)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W748_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W748_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W748_Task8" name="Cashier suggestion delivery">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Cashier suggestion delivery: Cashier presents suggestion naturally: &quot;Based on your purchase, you might also need...&quot; or &quot;You&#x27;re only PHP 500 away from Gold tier this month&quot;
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W748_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W748_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W748_Task9" name="Customer acceptance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Customer acceptance: If customer accepts: Cashier scans suggested item (fetched from nearby shelf/display by stock associate if needed); if customer declines, proceed with original transaction
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): Customer
Duration: 1–2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W748_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W748_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W748_Task10" name="Cross-sell service attachment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Cross-sell service attachment: For eligible products (e.g., appliance purchase), system prompts service attachment: extended warranty (W33), installation service (W138), delivery scheduling (W5D)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Cashier
Duration: 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W748_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W748_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W748_Task11" name="Suggestion analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Suggestion analytics: System logs suggestion delivery, acceptance/rejection, and resulting incremental revenue; feeds to W156 CDP for suggestion algorithm optimization
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W748_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W748_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W748_Task12" name="Weekly performance tracking">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Weekly performance tracking: Store Manager reviews upsell/cross-sell attachment rate per cashier in W522 daily transaction review; top performers recognized in W630 employee recognition program
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Part of W522</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W748_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W748_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W748_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W748_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W748_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-263 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Processing (PA-08.1).) | - operational: Cashier review and approval gate
Owner: Cashier</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W748_Assoc15" sourceRef="W748_Annotation14" targetRef="W748_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
