    <bpmn:process id="W_W1235" name="W1235. Store-Level Customer Financing Partner Kiosk Management &amp; Application Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer expresses interest in financing for high-value purchase (appliances, power tools, building materials) at store
Frequency: ~50–80 financing applications per store per month; ~10,000–16,000 applications/month chain-wide
Volume: 200 stores × ~65 applications/month = ~13,000 applications/month
Owner: Customer Service Rep
Participants: CSR, Department Supervisor, Partner Bank Representative, Customer
Source: workflow W1235 — Store-Level Customer Financing Partner Kiosk Management &amp; Application Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1235_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1235_Lane1" name="CSR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1235_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1235_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1235_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1235_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1235_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1235_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1235_Lane2" name="Finance – AR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1235_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1235_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1235_Start4" name="Customer expresses interest in financing for high-value purchase (appliances, power…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1235_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1235_Task5" name="Customer inquiry &amp; pre-qualification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer inquiry &amp; pre-qualification: Customer asks about installment options for a high-value item: (a) CSR explains available financing plans (3/6/12/24 months); (b) checks customer eligibility (valid Philippine ID, proof of income, minimum purchase amount per partner); (c) identifies which partner offers best terms for customer&#x27;s situation
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): Department Supervisor
Duration: 5–10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1235_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1235_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1235_Task6" name="Application processing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Application processing: CSR assists customer with financing application: (a) guide customer through partner application form (paper or digital kiosk); (b) capture required documents (government ID, payslip/business permit); (c) submit application to partner via kiosk or mobile app; (d) partner processes in real-time (2–15 minutes for instant decision)
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10–20 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1235_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1235_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1235_Task7" name="Credit decision &amp; communication">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Credit decision &amp; communication: (a) partner approves, declines, or offers modified terms; (b) CSR communicates decision to customer; (c) if approved: CSR proceeds with sale at POS; (d) if declined: offer alternative (different partner, lower amount, layaway per W75); (e) if modified terms: explain adjusted monthly payment and interest rate
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1235_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1235_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1235_Task8" name="POS transaction with financing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: POS transaction with financing: (a) CSR rings up sale at POS per W5B; (b) select financing partner as payment method; (c) enter approval code from partner; (d) POS records sale as fully paid (partner pays BuildRight); (e) generate customer charge slip for partner; (f) system records financing partner payment receivable for treasury reconciliation per W261
Responsible (R): CSR / Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1235_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1235_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1235_Task9" name="Kiosk &amp; collateral management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Kiosk &amp; collateral management: (a) CSR ensures financing kiosk/terminal is functional daily; (b) replenish application forms and brochures; (c) report kiosk malfunctions to partner and IT per W48; (d) maintain partner rate cards and promotional materials current (per W149 bank partnership); (e) secure completed applications per data privacy requirements per W53
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 10 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1235_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1235_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1235_Task10" name="Monthly reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Monthly reconciliation: (a) Finance reconciles financing partner payments received vs. POS financing transactions; (b) verify partner commission deductions; (c) investigate discrepancies; (d) report financing sales volume to Category Manager for promotional planning
Responsible (R): Finance – AR
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1235_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1235_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1235_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1235_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
