        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-263 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Processing (PA-08.1).) | - operational: Customer Service Rep review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Customer Service Rep</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1235_Assoc13" sourceRef="W1235_Annotation12" targetRef="W1235_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
