    <bpmn:process id="W_W1276" name="W1276. POS Multi-Tender Split Payment Processing &amp; Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer requests to pay for a single transaction using two or more payment methods (e.g., cash + e-wallet, credit card + loyalty points, cash + gift card)
Frequency: ~8–12% of POS transactions; ~224,000–336,000 split-tender transactions/month across 200 stores
Volume: ~1,100–1,700 per store per month; ~7,500–11,200 per day chain-wide (224,000–336,000/month per the Frequency)
Owner: Cashier
Participants: Cashier, Customer, Store Manager (override for complex splits)
Source: workflow W1276 — POS Multi-Tender Split Payment Processing &amp; Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1276_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1276_Lane1" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1276_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1276_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1276_Lane2" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1276_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1276_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1276_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1276_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1276_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1276_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1276_Lane4" name="Cash Office Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1276_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1276_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1276_Start6" name="Customer requests to pay for a single transaction using two or more payment methods…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1276_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1276_Task7" name="Customer completes item scanning per W5B; system displays transaction total…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer completes item scanning per W5B; system displays transaction total; customer requests split payment (&quot;I&#x27;ll pay PHP 1,000 in cash and the rest by GCash&quot;)
Responsible (R): Customer / Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1276_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1276_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1276_Task8" name="Cashier selects &quot;Split Payment&quot; function on POS terminal; system presents…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Cashier selects &quot;Split Payment&quot; function on POS terminal; system presents tender allocation screen with transaction total and available tender types: (a) Cash, (b) Credit/Debit Card, (c) E-Wallet (GCash/Maya), (d) Loyalty Points, (e) Gift Card / Store Credit, (f) Trade Account Charge (for registered trade accounts)
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1276_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1276_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1276_Task9" name="Tender entry sequence">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Tender entry sequence: Cashier enters amounts per tender type in any order; system validates in real-time: (a) sum of entered tenders must equal transaction total, (b) loyalty points — customer must be enrolled, sufficient point balance verified, points redeemed at PHP 1.00/point, maximum 50% of transaction total payable by points, (c) gift card — system verifies card balance in real-time, (d) trade account charge — customer account verified, credit limit checked, (e) e-wallet — standard QR/NFC processing per W1268, (f) cash — standard cash acceptance per W5B
Responsible (R): Cashier / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30–60 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1276_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1276_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1276_Task10" name="Partial tender processing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Partial tender processing: system processes each tender sequentially: (a) loyalty points deducted from customer account immediately, (b) gift card balance reduced immediately, (c) cash accepted — cashier enters bills received, system calculates change for cash portion only, (d) card/e-wallet — customer completes payment on PIN pad (insert/tap/QR scan), system receives authorization, (e) trade account charge — system posts charge to customer account; if any individual tender fails (card declined, e-wallet timeout), system allows retry of that tender type or substitution with another without restarting entire transaction
Responsible (R): Cashier / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 60–120 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1276_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1276_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1276_Task11" name="System validation and transaction completion">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: System validation and transaction completion: after all tenders entered and processed: (a) system verifies total tenders = transaction total (zero balance), (b) posts revenue to GL by item, (c) posts cash received to cash GL, (d) posts card/e-wallet to respective receivable GL, (e) posts loyalty points redemption to points liability GL, (f) posts gift card redemption to gift card liability GL, (g) prints receipt showing itemized breakdown of all tenders used with amount per tender, (h) transaction event published per W533 with split-tender flag and individual tender details
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1276_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1276_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1276_Task12" name="Change calculation and dispensing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Change calculation and dispensing: if cash tender exceeds cash portion owed: (a) system calculates change based only on cash portion (not total transaction), (b) cash recycler dispenses change, (c) cashier hands change to customer along with receipt
Responsible (R): System / Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1276_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1276_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1276_Task13" name="End-of-day reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: End-of-day reconciliation: split-tender transactions are included in standard Z-report (W574) with breakdown by tender type; Cash Office Clerk reconciles each tender type separately per W541 (cash), W537 (card), W1268 (e-wallet); system provides split-tender transaction detail report for cross-referencing if discrepancies arise
Responsible (R): Cash Office Clerk
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per W541/W537/W1268</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1276_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1276_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1276_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1276_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1276_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-263 (ensure controlled execution — Transaction Processing (PA-08.1).) | - operational: must handle partial rollback gracefully without requiring manual intervention
Owner: Cashier</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1276_Assoc16" sourceRef="W1276_Annotation15" targetRef="W1276_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1276_Flow17" sourceRef="W1276_Start6" targetRef="W1276_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1276_Flow18" sourceRef="W1276_Task7" targetRef="W1276_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1276_Flow19" sourceRef="W1276_Task8" targetRef="W1276_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1276_Flow20" sourceRef="W1276_Task9" targetRef="W1276_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1276_Flow21" sourceRef="W1276_Task10" targetRef="W1276_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1276_Flow22" sourceRef="W1276_Task11" targetRef="W1276_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1276_Flow23" sourceRef="W1276_Task12" targetRef="W1276_Task13" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1276_Flow24" sourceRef="W1276_Task13" targetRef="W1276_End14" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W1276_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W1276_plane" bpmnElement="W_W1276">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1276_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W1276_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
